# @hub-lanes

# ── LEAD REVIEW PRECISION (BH-3479.4) ─────────────────────────────────────
# bin/lead-review-precision.sh — daily 05:40Z, score every PR merged in the last
# LEAD_REVIEW_PRECISION_WINDOW_DAYS whose merged head carries a lead MERGE:
# reverted on main, or a failed/cancelled `Queue:` check run on the head.
# Writes state/lead-review-precision/<day>.json; one warn beat a day under
# LEAD_REVIEW_PRECISION_WARN. No model call, no SSH. Off via
# flags/lane-off-lead-review-precision. Log: logs/lead-review-precision.log.
40 5 * * * /root/harness/bin/hub-lease.sh check && /root/harness/bin/lead-review-precision.sh >/dev/null 2>&1
